# All knobs at both ends, the lowest and highest notes (C0, C8, G9: the last mip, pitch held at 11 kHz), velocities
# 1 and 127, P1/P2 jumping between 0 and 255 and a full bend on the highest note.
tempo 120
steps 16
tail 0.3
track lead
preset 255 255 0 0 255 0 0 0 0 255 128 255 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 C0 4 127
note 4 C8 4 127
param p1 0 8
param p2 0 8
note 8 C2 4 1
param p1 255 10
param p2 255 10
note 12 G9 4 127
bend 12 200
param p1 0 14
param p2 128 14
expect peak_below -4
